eur. </br><span class=\"strong\">Tim</span> : C'est pas vrai !", "type": "example"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":8,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Fa\u00e7on d'exprimer la surprise ou l'int\u00e9r\u00eat\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Je ne te crois pas !</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Ouah, tu plaisantes  !</span></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Vraiment ?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Tu m'\u00e9tonnes ?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">C'est pas vrai !</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Trop g\u00e9nial !</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">\u00c7a alors ! </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "Salut", "type": "name"}, {"content": "un autre fa\u00e7on de dire Bonjour", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Salut Coraline !", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn3le03ob02aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "Voici des mots que vous utilisez pour parler des films d'horreur.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "le film d'horreur", "type": "name"}, {"content": "un film qui fait peur", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : J'aime les films d'horreur.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn3le03ob02aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "la peur ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "